#!/usr/bin/env python3
# MISE description="Read NewsBlur feeds in an fzf terminal reader"
# MISE quiet=true
"""An fzf-based NewsBlur reader. Run with `mise run rss`.

Each feed visit loads fresh stories from NewsBlur. Preview files exist only for
that visit and are removed on exit; only authentication cookies persist.
Read-state actions run serially in the background of a single live fzf process.

NewsBlur validates API responses; StoryCollection owns paging and read state;
FeedSession owns visit-scoped resources; StoryStream presents snapshots;
ReadStateActions serializes mutations; LivePicker owns fzf and its updater.
"""

